    "bodyText": "Untitled Project\n▼\n▼\n▼\n▼\n▼\n▼\n▼\n▼\nSign in\nElements\n▼\n2D Elements\n\nNo elements yet. Use the tools to create points, lines, and other geometric objects.\n\n▼\n3D Elements\n\nNo 3D elements yet. Use the 3D tools to create points, lines, and other objects from projections.\n\nNo elements yet. Start creating geometry!\n\nConstruction History\n<\n>\n▼\nRoot Process\n●\n▼\n▲\n➤\nShow Planes\nShow 2D Elements on Planes\nShow Grid\nShow Reference Axes\nPlane:\nTool:\nSelect\n3D:\n---",
